Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.83,0:01:03.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看 出现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}見ろ! 出た!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.09,0:01:06.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有敌人来袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}敵襲来だ! 敵だ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.13,0:01:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}見ろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:08.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}急げ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.84,0:01:10.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.59,0:01:12.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟广岛的情况一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}広島と同じだ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.51,0:01:13.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}早くしろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.68,0:01:15.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げろ! 早くしろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.06,0:01:20.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げろ! 早くしろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:51.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救命 救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.93,0:01:55.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.14,0:02:00.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别打了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やめろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.17,0:02:27.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.75,0:02:28.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.38,0:02:30.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是B-29轰炸机 小子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a B-29, bub.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.47,0:02:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是逃不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no outrunning what's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.22,0:02:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yashida!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.80,0:02:40.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田先生 你在干什么 快过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}矢志田貴様何をしてる? 早くしろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.47,0:02:42.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田 快过来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}矢志田 早くしろ!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.81,0:02:44.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是下来比较好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're better off down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.69,0:02:45.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 矢志田 - 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 矢志田! - はい!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.48,0:02:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就过去...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ただいま...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:48.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是你就赶紧跳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd hurry if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.09,0:03:55.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑 马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run. Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:07.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.86,0:04:57.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 等等 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait! No, no. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.78,0:05:02.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要这样 不能出去 不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, no. It's not safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.37,0:05:07.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,醒醒 醒醒 快醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wake up, wake up, wake up. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.50,0:05:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,梦到什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:15.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长崎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.55,0:05:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么久之前的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That far back?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.02,0:05:29.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.06,0:05:30.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能留下来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:33.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我不可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.86,0:05:36.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴 真的很对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jean, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.36,0:05:38.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我懂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.49,0:05:42.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再也不会伤害你或其他任何人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll never hurt you or anyone ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.32,0:05:43.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我发过誓的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made a vow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.32,0:05:45.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是神圣誓言吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A solemn vow?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.54,0:05:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在取笑我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're making fun of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.50,0:05:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太迟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.67,0:06:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 不 琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! No, Jean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.72,0:06:02.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不不不 不要啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, no, no! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.68,0:06:03.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是躲不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.76,0:06:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 不不不 不要啊 - 你躲不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No, no, no! Please! - You can't hide!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.05,0:06:07.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Jean!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.66,0:06:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.84,0:08:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分都配有瞄准镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most decorates with scope, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.72,0:08:05.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎物不可能逃掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They never get away.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.34,0:08:08.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都记为赊账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whack all of that on store credit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.01,0:08:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢啦 亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.39,0:08:14.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 买到箭了吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got the arrows? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.39,0:08:17.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没忘了买箭吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remember the arrows?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没忘没忘 艾迪 已经买了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, yeah, Eddie, we got them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.49,0:08:31.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天呐 你差点废了他的脚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, you almost blew his foot off!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.79,0:08:36.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是猎人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not a hunter, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.67,0:08:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.77,0:09:39.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.45,0:09:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别逼我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't make me do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.12,0:10:43.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个大家伙估计有12英尺高\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It must have been damn near 12 feet tall.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们一开始只听到踩断树枝的声音\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We didn't hear nothing except twigs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.88,0:10:49.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后它就扑过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then it just came upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.34,0:10:53.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它抓住了莱利 把他开膛破肚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It got Riley, just gutted him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:54.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后又抓住艾迪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It got Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.34,0:10:56.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,撕烂了帐篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ripped through the tent,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.39,0:10:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把雪地车像玩具一样撞翻了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}knocked over the snowcat like it was a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.02,0:11:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是那个被灰熊攻击的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You the one was attacked by the grizzly?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.69,0:11:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是幸存的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the one that survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:15.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想请这位先生喝杯酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd like to buy this man a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.49,0:11:20.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's your name, mister?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:31.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.05,0:11:37.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这箭头上涂了毒 据我所知这是非法的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that's a poison broadhead, which, last I heard, was illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.02,0:11:50.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊 问问我是从哪儿找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go ahead, ask me where I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.99,0:12:02.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快问啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.20,0:12:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你从哪儿找到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.54,0:12:06.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个问题问得好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, funny you should ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:09.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是从一头灰熊身上拔下来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I pulled it out of the back of a grizzly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.63,0:12:10.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射出这支箭的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever shot it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.67,0:12:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没种继续追捕那头熊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}didn't have the wind or the balls to track the animal properly...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.17,0:12:15.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让它痛痛快快地解脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and put it out of its misery.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.39,0:12:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他下的毒药不足以立刻致死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead of dropping a lethal dose of the poison...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.81,0:12:25.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是让熊痛苦发狂 最终杀死了五个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it bled into the bear, made him crazy, killed five people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.48,0:12:29.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的箭可没有浸毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I don't dip my arrows in anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.27,0:12:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就没什么好担心的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that case, you got nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.82,0:12:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.33,0:12:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了 琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.50,0:12:55.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要是你 就不会费力出手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't bother with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.88,0:12:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使你不出手 他们也不久于世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of them will die soon anyway, without your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.64,0:13:03.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其中三个 一周后就会死在同一辆卡车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three of them, a week from now, in the same truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.74,0:13:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这把剑已经有几百年的历史了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This sword is hundreds of years old
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.95,0:13:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一位使用它的武士给它起名叫丹曾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and was named Danzan by the first samurai who used it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.50,0:13:30.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,丹曾在日语里是"分割"的意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danzan means "Separator" In Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.67,0:13:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它是分割头颅与四肢的理想武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ideal weapon for separating head and limb from body.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.77,0:13:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:52.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的车停在后巷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm parked in back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.41,0:14:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.54,0:14:17.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见谅 这车是租来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, it's a rental.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.47,0:14:21.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.88,0:14:24.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我吗 我叫雪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me? I'm Yukio.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.80,0:14:25.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.93,0:14:29.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试图找你有一年多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been trying to find you for over a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.52,0:14:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.73,0:14:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.48,0:14:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的雇主希望你能收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My employer wanted you to have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:38.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的雇主是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's your employer?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.86,0:14:40.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.92,0:14:58.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说那是你的东西 他要把欠下的债都还清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said it belongs to you, and that he's paying all debts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.21,0:15:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人快要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yashida is dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.63,0:15:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想对你说声谢谢 感谢你多年前救了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to say thank you for saving his life all those years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.10,0:15:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道你是个...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows that you are a...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.81,0:15:11.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大忙人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}busy man.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.06,0:15:14.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他真的很想亲自和你告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he very much wants to say his goodbye in person.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.06,0:15:16.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 他在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.86,0:15:17.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,东京\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.44,0:15:20.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 我才不去日本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait...I'm not going to Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.61,0:15:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连临终之人的请求都拒绝 太不近人情了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be dishonorable for you to refuse his request.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.95,0:15:26.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那还真是对不起矢志田先生了 我不会去东京的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, apologize to Mr. Yashida, I'm not going to Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.41,0:15:29.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗 我还有事要办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right? I've got things to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.37,0:15:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用道歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.75,0:15:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能见到金刚狼已是我莫大的荣幸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been an honor just to meet the Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.46,0:15:39.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经不是金刚狼了 明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's not who I am anymore, you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.71,0:15:42.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.17,0:15:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不是为了伸张正义 为何去那家酒吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you go into that bar, if not to seek justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.80,0:15:46.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你不知道吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't know. - You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.93,0:15:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我觉得你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No! - I think you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.55,0:15:50.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 停车 - 你是一名战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Pull over. - You are a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.68,0:15:51.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我不是 停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I'm not. Pull over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.89,0:15:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是一名战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull over, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.06,0:15:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.82,0:16:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你骨子里是名战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a soldier,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.74,0:16:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跟所有战士都有着同样的追求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you seek what all soldiers do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.11,0:16:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追求什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.82,0:16:08.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,体面的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An honorable death.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.99,0:16:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,痛苦的终结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An end to your pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.91,0:16:13.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁说我处于痛苦之中的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who says I'm in pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:18.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜夜做噩梦的人怎么会不痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man who has nightmares every night of his life is in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:37.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一天时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.60,0:16:41.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和矢志田先生告别后 我就立马回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I say goodbye to Mr. Yashida and I come right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.62,0:16:53.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15个小时的航程 取决于风向和风速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen hours. Depending on the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.45,0:16:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15个小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifteen hours?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.21,0:16:58.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不喜欢飞行吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't like to fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.96,0:17:00.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:30.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.95,0:17:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.66,0:17:38.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,“狼獾”是什么意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri. What does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.71,0:17:39.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.17,0:17:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不疼吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pain?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.34,0:17:47.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你感觉不到... - 当然疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have no... - Oh, yeah. Pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.01,0:17:50.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plenty of pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.89,0:17:59.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很久很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.60,0:18:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经历了很多战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:03.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.07,0:18:10.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太多该死的战争了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too many fuckin' wars.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.58,0:18:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就快到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.46,0:18:26.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能预见未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you can see the future?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.09,0:18:28.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会看地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can read a map.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.76,0:18:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说你知道酒吧里那些混蛋的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said you knew the future of those assholes in the bar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.51,0:18:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他们会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know they are going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.51,0:18:38.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are all going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.85,0:18:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说他们一周后会死在同一辆卡车里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said they would die in the same truck, in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.94,0:18:45.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果应验了的话 那真是了不起的超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're right, that's quite a talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.57,0:18:50.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是所有人的超能力都是爪子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't all have claws.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.78,0:18:55.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我会死在这架飞机上吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, do I die on this plane?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.83,0:18:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.16,0:19:01.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,至少不是这架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not on this plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.36,0:19:28.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别被这些灯光蒙蔽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the lights fool you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.94,0:19:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本还处于黑暗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are dark days in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.90,0:19:34.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人认为一旦矢志田大人病倒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some believe when Master Yashida got sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.91,0:19:36.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本便会蒙上阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a shadow fell upon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.53,0:19:38.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也觉得他是神吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you think he's a god?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.62,0:19:43.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 他只是个人 不过是个伟人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. A man. But a great one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.46,0:19:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战后 他帮助日本重建\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the war, he helped rebuild the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.88,0:19:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的家族企业也成为日本最大的企业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the family business became Japan's largest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.67,0:19:52.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们把这些做成卡片让你们背诵了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did they give you a little card to memorize?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.55,0:19:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的命是矢志田大人救的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe Master Yashida my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.93,0:19:58.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别犯浑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be a dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.95,0:20:15.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么多枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.20,0:20:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为最近遇到了几次袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There have been attacks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.78,0:20:19.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绑架未遂 刺杀未遂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attempted kidnappings. Attempted assassinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁指使的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.20,0:20:23.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本的黑帮 山口组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Japanese mob, the Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.04,0:20:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政府越来越弱 他们却发展壮大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They've grown strong as the government has grown weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.87,0:20:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有武器反应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}武器の反応あり
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.54,0:20:28.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}大丈夫だから
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你的武器拿出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}武器を見せてください
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.46,0:20:30.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是说了他没问题吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}大丈夫だって言ってるでしょ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.46,0:20:31.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做过髋关节置换手术\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hip replacement.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.47,0:20:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请换上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どうぞ　お履きください
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.39,0:20:42.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh, too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.39,0:20:45.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太小了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too small.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.22,0:21:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.39,0:21:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄 矢志田大人的儿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shingen, Master Yashida's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.27,0:21:29.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他挺厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.61,0:21:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也就还行吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.05,0:21:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お久しぶりです
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:40.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么不让穿靴子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what happened to the badass in boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.66,0:21:42.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人是个传统的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yashida is traditional.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.99,0:21:46.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,既怀念过去 又紧盯未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One eye on the past and the other on the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.17,0:21:57.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爷爷 您还活着 我不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}生きたから　そんなお爺様
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.22,0:21:59.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这必须由你来做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前でなければできない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.80,0:22:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是真理子 他的孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Mariko, his granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.20,0:22:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.83,0:22:27.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どうした?　何があったの?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.92,0:22:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}大丈夫　なんでもない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.59,0:22:39.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最近都没有回我邮件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}メールだって最近全然返事がないし
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.80,0:22:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不能告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今は説明できない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.30,0:22:44.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么 你跟我说清楚啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どうして　ちゃんと言ってよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.64,0:22:50.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个脏兮兮的人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの汚い人は誰?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.10,0:22:54.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你爷爷让我找的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの方は矢志田様が捜してと言ってた人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.90,0:22:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能让他这样子见爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あんな汚い格好でお爺様に会わせないで
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.95,0:23:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,静和沙纪会为你消毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shizu and Saki are going to disinfect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.79,0:23:13.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你修剪毛发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give you a shave.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.00,0:23:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她们敢动我试试看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like hell they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.96,0:23:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到浴缸里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:20.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到浴缸里去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get in the tub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.22,0:23:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.63,0:23:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坐好 - 坐好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 座りなさい　- 座りなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:26.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坐好 - 好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 座りなさい - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.53,0:23:28.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 坐好 - 你不要动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 座りなさい　- もう動かないで　ちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.97,0:23:30.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 舒服吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}なに　気持ちいいでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.39,0:23:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}このままにしてなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.52,0:23:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.94,0:23:37.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 好了 这个我自己来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, all right, all right. I can do that bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.41,0:23:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.70,0:23:51.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.58,0:23:54.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看上去很帅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.62,0:23:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得被侵犯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel violated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.71,0:24:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为矢志田大人再准备两瓶抑制剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prepare two more suppressors for Master Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.67,0:24:02.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后测一下他的血压\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And check his blood pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.15,0:24:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yashida-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.82,0:24:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我完成您交代的任务了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ご用命通りに
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.41,0:24:30.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.87,0:24:32.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还是老样子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.58,0:24:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这也没什么奇怪的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, then, that is no surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Green.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:40.71,0:24:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请你先退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave us, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.55,0:24:45.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five minutes, no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.89,0:24:50.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我的肿瘤治疗专家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My oncologist.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.14,0:24:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不错啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.85,0:25:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用了 雪生 这种预防措施对我已经没用了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, forget that, Yukio. I'm past such precautions.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.70,0:25:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多年来 我一直想感谢你的救命之恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For many years I have wanted to thank you for saving my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.45,0:25:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当年对我也大发善心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.91,0:25:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对很多人都很友善\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you were kind to many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.29,0:25:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在那个深井里甚至都看出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw that even from that well.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.11,0:25:44.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,画上画的是我出生的村庄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The painting is from the village of my birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.98,0:25:49.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,描绘出了黑衣族的勇猛和高超技艺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depicts the bravery and skill of the Black Clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.41,0:25:51.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忍者武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ninja warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.88,0:25:55.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经守护我们家族七个世纪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They served my family for seven centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.83,0:26:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找你来并非只是想感谢你 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't send for you only to thank you, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.17,0:26:04.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要报答你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.84,0:26:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你一些别人都给不了的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To offer you something no one else can.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.64,0:26:14.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一份可以报答救命之恩的礼物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A gift to equal the life you gave to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.47,0:26:15.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都不需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't need anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.93,0:26:17.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非一件物品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.35,0:26:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永生是种诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eternity can be a curse.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.06,0:26:25.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对你来说 没有尽头的生命并不容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It hasn't been easy for you, living without time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.61,0:26:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要承受很多失去的痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The losses you have had to suffer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.24,0:26:31.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人可能会失去活着的意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A man can run out of things to live for.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.95,0:26:33.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失去人生目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lose his purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.78,0:26:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为一个浪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Become a ronin.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.95,0:26:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个无主的武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A samurai without a master.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.63,0:26:46.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你终结这种永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can end your eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.80,0:26:49.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你成为凡人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Make you mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.04,0:26:54.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们对我所做的 现在这样的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they did to me, what I am,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.51,0:26:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是无法逆转的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.31,0:26:59.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田工业是无所不能的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yashida Industries can do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.89,0:27:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有理由相信你的愈合能力是可以转移的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have reason to believe your ability to heal can be passed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.77,0:27:06.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转移\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Passed?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.69,0:27:08.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从你身上转移到别人身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From you to another.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.90,0:27:14.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经挣扎了太久 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have struggled long enough, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.37,0:27:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我糊涂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.79,0:27:21.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来这里只是为了跟故交告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I came here to say goodbye to a man I once knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.54,0:27:23.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的想法没有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当年我还没有准备好赴死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was not ready to die then.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.04,0:27:28.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还是没有准备好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not ready to die now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.34,0:27:31.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你已经准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.72,0:27:32.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.55,0:27:38.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你这是提出要杀了我 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you offering to kill me? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.06,0:27:39.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是让你马上死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.56,0:27:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以过完你悠长平凡的一生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can live a long and ordinary life.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.35,0:27:47.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恋爱 成家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fll in love, have a family,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.15,0:27:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢变老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}grow old.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.98,0:27:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后有一天 正常死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one day, die an ordinary death.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.74,0:28:00.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是可以做到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It can be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.58,0:28:04.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 够了 再次见到你很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, look, nice to see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.71,0:28:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾你病了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry you got sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.92,0:28:07.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了 罗根先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, Logan-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.67,0:28:09.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你再次相助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.71,0:28:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心我的家人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear for my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.88,0:28:14.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我担心我亲手建立的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I fear for everything I have built.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.18,0:28:14.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 - 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Enough. - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.97,0:28:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求你了 罗根先生 - 你该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please, Logan-san. - You should leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.72,0:28:18.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're going to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.30,0:28:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.01,0:28:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子 我孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko, my granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.64,0:28:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是我的掌上明珠 一定要保护好她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is my treasure. She must be protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.69,0:28:30.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会想要我的超能力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't want what I've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.32,0:28:34.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.74,0:28:35.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.87,0:28:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄大人 您父亲在找您\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}信玄様　お父様がお呼びでございます
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.04,0:28:46.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于等到这个时候了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}時が来たか
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.25,0:28:52.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お父様　お父様
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.30,0:28:55.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 小姐 您请回吧 - 让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- お嬢様　どうぞお引きください　- どいてよ
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.30,0:28:57.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 您不能进去 - 你让我进去 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- ご入室できません　- ちょっと通して　お父様
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.36,0:28:59.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不能进去 真理子小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ご入室できません　真理子様
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.10,0:29:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在我父亲去找爷爷前 我要和他谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お爺様にお会いになられる前に　お話があるの
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.93,0:29:02.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开 父亲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どいてよ　お父様
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.52,0:29:03.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您看这要怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どう致しましょうか
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.64,0:29:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一会儿会和你谈 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}信玄様は　明日の朝　お話になりたいと
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.39,0:29:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲 我现在就要和你谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今じゃなきゃダメなの　お父様
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.16,0:29:08.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在不行 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今はならん　真理子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.78,0:29:16.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求您了 父亲 - 你快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- お願いです　お父様　- 離れなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.24,0:29:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 父亲 您听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}待ってくださいお父様　話を聞いて下さい
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.41,0:29:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不是说了现在不行吗 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今はならんと言ってるんだ　真理子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.78,0:29:24.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 求您了 父亲 - 以后再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- お願いです　お父様　- 後にしなさい！
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.13,0:29:25.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}話を聞いて下さい
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.15,0:29:26.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲现在都快断气了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私の父が息を引き取ろうとしている
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.00,0:29:28.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以您现在才要听我说清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}だからこそ今聞いていただかなきゃならないだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.77,0:29:29.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要挡着我 快点离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ここをどきなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.96,0:29:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你总是这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}君はいつだってそうだよ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:33.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以爷爷才会那么难过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}だからお爺様が悲しむんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.48,0:29:51.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子小姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}真理子様
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.99,0:30:01.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 小心 这里很滑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, careful. It's slippery out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.47,0:30:03.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.76,0:30:07.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你闹够了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You about done?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.67,0:30:10.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.85,0:30:32.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说他只是想和我告别吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He just wanted to say goodbye, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.20,0:30:42.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两个一起长大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two grew up together.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.07,0:30:44.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.95,0:30:46.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你并不是她的妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're not her sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.04,0:30:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.04,0:30:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人在去南方时发现了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yashida found me on a trip to the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.46,0:30:58.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他带真理子去参观一个他正在建设的工厂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought Mariko to see a factory he was building.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.76,0:31:05.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当时正在垃圾堆里翻找食物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was digging through the garbage for something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.14,0:31:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他们就带你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they just took you home with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.14,0:31:13.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子一直很难交到朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was always difficult for Mariko to make friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.86,0:31:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会安排飞机明天一早起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see to it the plane is ready in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.87,0:31:26.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先睡这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sleep here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.18,0:31:49.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你别一脸失望的样子啊 信玄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}そんなにがっかりした顔するなよ　信玄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.31,0:31:52.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没死透呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私はまだ死んじゃいない
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.48,0:31:55.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要我的话 就去办公室找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll be in my office if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.82,0:32:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来的话很难开口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}これを言うのは容易いことではないが
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.70,0:32:10.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我们之间对话从来都很困难 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}我ら親子の間には容易いことなどなに一つなかったな
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.12,0:32:14.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我努力过了 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}謹んで務めてまいりました
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.54,0:32:16.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前は最善を尽くしたのだろう
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.22,0:32:30.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直是我认定的继承者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have always been my assumed successor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.02,0:32:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过去的几年 作为考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So the past few years, as a test,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.31,0:32:35.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我让你握有更多的控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I allowed you more control.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.48,0:32:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.98,0:32:41.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我现在意识到 那是个错误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I now realize that was a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.32,0:32:46.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把公司推向了毁灭的边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have brought this company close to ruin.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.28,0:32:52.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我死后 会有其他人代替我成为总裁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I die, someone else will take my place as chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.29,0:33:00.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,父亲 如果让您失望了 我很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, I'm sorry if I have disappointed you...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.21,0:33:03.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就别说些假话来侮辱彼此了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's not insult one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.59,0:33:06.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不会成为矢志田家族的领导者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are not the man to lead Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.72,0:33:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您不能让外人来当领导\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You cannot bring in someone from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.64,0:33:15.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一点 你说得没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In that, you are correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.17,0:33:39.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我绝对不允许这种事情发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}そんなことは絶対に許されない
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.18,0:33:56.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永生是种诅咒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eternity can be a curse
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.94,0:33:58.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.31,0:34:01.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你感觉不到疼痛吗 狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have no pain, Kuzuri?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.86,0:34:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你活多久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How old are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.61,0:34:05.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个有趣的提议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.95,0:34:11.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要拒绝那个老人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing turning the old man down?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.28,0:34:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你想和我在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you wanted to be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.29,0:34:16.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.09,0:35:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他去世了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.30,0:35:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没预见到会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't foresee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.72,0:35:32.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您对从您的父辈开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お父上の時代から　最大の立会者であり
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.82,0:35:35.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最大的立会人矢志田一郎先生的死有什么看法呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}うじの男性だった矢志田一郎さんの死についてどう思われますか
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.78,0:35:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该怎么说呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}なんと申し上げれるか
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.44,0:36:51.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和真理子在一起的是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's that? With Mariko.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.03,0:36:53.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫森信郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His name is Noburo Mori.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.61,0:36:56.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,司法部长 政界新星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Minister of Justice, a rising star.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.41,0:36:58.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子的未婚夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's Mariko's fiance.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.28,0:37:00.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你得鞠躬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.67,0:37:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鞠躬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bow.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.30,0:37:15.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄大人 这位是罗根先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lord Shingen, this is Mr. Logan.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.38,0:37:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.76,0:37:19.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你父亲是个好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.10,0:37:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是这么说你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He would often say the same about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.73,0:37:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过话又说回来 他一直痴迷于你们这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But then, he was always fascinated with your kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.94,0:37:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我 你觉得他为什么让雪生去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, why do you think he sent our little Yukio to fetch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.49,0:37:37.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来告别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.53,0:37:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那既然已经告别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.41,0:37:44.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也该打道回府了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time for you to go back to your cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.76,0:38:02.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还希望我见见什么人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone else you want me to meet?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.70,0:38:24.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我向您起誓\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私は誓います
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.95,0:38:26.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}矢志田様
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.75,0:38:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将保持警惕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}警戒を怠らず
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.87,0:38:31.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不惜性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}真理子を守ることに
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.92,0:38:34.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保护真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}人生を捧げると
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.97,0:38:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是白银武士的盔甲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That armor belonged to Shiruba-Samurai
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.47,0:38:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是银武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Silver Samurai.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.72,0:38:47.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它将永远守护着它的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It will stand watch over the old man forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.16,0:39:06.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.88,0:39:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么地方不对劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.88,0:39:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.46,0:39:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能请您退下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}下がっていただけますか
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.97,0:39:21.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}下がりなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.01,0:39:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}下がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:24.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}さがりなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.10,0:39:26.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}下がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.47,0:39:28.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}さがりなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.98,0:39:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}下がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.62,0:39:45.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.08,0:39:49.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.46,0:39:56.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}放して
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.86,0:40:17.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.01,0:40:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你拍什么拍 快给我关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ビデオ撮ってんじゃねえぞこら　止めろこら
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.27,0:41:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投降吧 外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}伏せろ　外人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.60,0:41:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快把她带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}連れて行ってください
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.44,0:41:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行くぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.77,0:41:39.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投降吧 外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}伏せろ　外人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.81,0:41:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为你能逃得掉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げられるですか
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.69,0:41:41.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行け
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.04,0:41:59.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.21,0:42:03.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go. Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.39,0:42:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 雪生 - 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yukio! - Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.64,0:42:18.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どこへ行く
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.23,0:42:21.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行け
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.57,0:43:08.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.40,0:43:09.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃げるな
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.99,0:43:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}待って
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.91,0:43:12.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行くぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.57,0:43:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ほら行くぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.96,0:44:02.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Let's go, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.39,0:44:19.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}待ちなさい
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.16,0:44:41.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子干什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}何やってんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.37,0:44:44.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到这边来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, here! Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.35,0:44:59.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}止まれ
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.06,0:45:01.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In here! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.68,0:45:05.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我杀了你 死外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}殺すぞ　こら　外人
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.11,0:45:11.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会放过你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}逃がさんぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.28,0:45:19.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑 继续跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving, keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.20,0:45:21.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.96,0:45:32.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在流血 你需要救治\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're bleeding. You need help.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.51,0:45:33.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先跑吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.52,0:45:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你刚刚所做的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you for what you did back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.39,0:45:47.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 那些是山口组的人 - 我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Those were Yakuza. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.23,0:45:48.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们为什么追杀你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are they after you?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.94,0:45:51.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事 从这里开始我自己走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine. I can make my way from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.69,0:45:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该走了 去找个医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should go. Get yourself a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.16,0:46:48.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真舒服\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.67,0:46:52.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是新干线列车对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is one of those bullet trains, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.79,0:46:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说了我不需要你的帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I don't need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.05,0:46:58.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它能跑多快 每小时300英里吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So what do they do, like, 300 miles an hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.18,0:47:04.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦您说一句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お願いします
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.10,0:47:10.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次卑鄙的袭击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今回の卑劣極まりない厚かましいとしか言えぬ犯行は
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.19,0:47:14.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是暴力团伙那帮人所为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}暴力団の仕業であります
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.36,0:47:16.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我曾经粉碎过他们的犯罪计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}組織犯罪の取り締まりを強化した
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.57,0:47:19.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以这就应该是他们的暴力反抗行为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}我々に対する暴力的な反応だと言えるでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.07,0:47:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人看到他们从北门出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}目撃者によると北門から出ていたそうです
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.87,0:47:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她跟那个奇怪的外国人在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの　不思議な外人に連れ添われ
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.67,0:47:37.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的那位外国朋友在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your gaijin friend, where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.42,0:47:39.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一次看到他时 他在保护您的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last I saw, he was protecting your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.97,0:47:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不过是个玩偶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a toy doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.93,0:47:47.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,陪伴小孩子的玩具 她长大了 不再需要你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A companion for a child who has outgrown you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.18,0:47:48.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你最好记住这一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.85,0:47:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佳世 你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}佳世　大丈夫か
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.53,0:48:03.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是要去哪儿 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where are we headed, Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.54,0:48:09.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们要去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.29,0:48:13.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会在终点下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.67,0:48:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们家在南边有座房子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My family has a home in the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.55,0:48:17.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太蠢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.51,0:48:21.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无意冒犯 但他们肯定知道去那里找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No offense, but they're gonna know to look for you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.80,0:48:23.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个地方他们不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.51,0:48:25.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 你不希望被打扰 - 没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You want to be left alone. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.93,0:48:27.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我理解 - 真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I understand. - Do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.14,0:48:28.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah. Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.93,0:48:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是 我若真离开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Problem is, if I do that
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.10,0:48:32.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怕是连一天都活不过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think you're gonna live to see the end of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.90,0:48:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,坏事发生时 你不能假装它没发生 小公主\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't pretend shit isn't happening when it is, princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.74,0:48:40.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非你想寻死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.90,0:48:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样的话 你这样胡闹倒是没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in that case, you are playing this perfectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.35,0:49:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么鬼情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.29,0:49:32.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.83,0:49:38.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの外人だ
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.13,0:49:43.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是那个外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの外人だ
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.56,0:49:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}撃て
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.23,0:49:58.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}撃つぞ
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.56,0:49:59.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やっちまえ
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.37,0:52:21.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这是怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.33,0:52:22.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快下车 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get off here. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.79,0:52:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我说 我们得找个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just listen to me, will you? We need to find someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.13,0:52:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.66,0:52:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他们是山口组的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know they were Yakuza?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.88,0:52:31.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们和庙里的袭击者是同一伙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were the same guys from the temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.05,0:52:31.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道他们在追杀我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know they were after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.97,0:52:33.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 我们要找个安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, we need to find someplace safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.64,0:52:34.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能待在大街上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get off the streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.43,0:52:36.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不明白 - 闭嘴 听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't understand. - Shut up! Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.68,0:52:38.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你熟悉这地方吗 市区在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know this place? Where's downtown?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.10,0:52:40.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.28,0:52:52.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那闹市区在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where's the nice part of town?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.36,0:52:53.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,往那边走八个街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Another eight blocks that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.86,0:52:56.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我们就待在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good. We're staying here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.53,0:52:57.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.79,0:53:04.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是家情侣宾馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a love hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.92,0:53:05.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么宾馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.50,0:53:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情侣宾馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A love hotel.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.38,0:53:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,专为情侣服务的 懂了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For couples, understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.09,0:53:14.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.55,0:53:20.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要两个房间 相邻的 同一层的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two rooms. Adjoining rooms, on the same floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.22,0:53:21.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听不懂英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}英語話せない
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.35,0:53:22.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 要相邻的 - 我听不懂英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Right next to each other. - 英語話せない
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.84,0:53:23.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紧挨着的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very close.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.56,0:53:24.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不懂 英语 不懂 英语 不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ノー　英語　ノー　英語　ノー
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.65,0:53:25.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 听不懂英语 - 同一层 同一层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 英語　ノー - Same floor. Same floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.85,0:53:28.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,英语 不懂 英语 不懂不懂不懂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ノー　英語　英語ノーノーノー
Dialogue: 0,0:53:28.73,0:53:30.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们想要两个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの　二部屋お願いしたいんですけど　
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.21,0:53:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有相邻的房间吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}隣同士になってるとこありますか
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.99,0:53:35.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在人很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今混んでるからね
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.03,0:53:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在空着的房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}空いてんのはね
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.03,0:53:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就只有地牢房 护士房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}地下の牢屋　ナースの部屋
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.46,0:53:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有火星探险房了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}火星探検
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.17,0:53:46.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.17,0:53:50.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她说没有相邻的房间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has no rooms available next to each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.50,0:53:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她问我们要地牢房 护士房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's asking if we prefer "The dungeon", "The nurse's office",
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.09,0:53:58.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是火星探险房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or the "Mission to Mars."
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.99,0:54:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这倒也可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.33,0:54:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发射 即将发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Liftoff! We have a liftoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.79,0:54:24.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实还挺温馨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kind of homey, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.25,0:54:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算睡哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you plan on sleeping?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.76,0:54:37.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不睡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.00,0:55:14.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你流了好多血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a lot of blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.17,0:55:18.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为你不再当英雄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were done being the hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.55,0:55:23.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但那些人打算杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But these guys were trying to kill her.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.31,0:55:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放弃吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.85,0:55:31.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡并非难事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not hard to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.27,0:55:35.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来我这儿吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.22,0:56:03.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.26,0:56:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你走神了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're slipping.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.02,0:56:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你给我站住 你逃不掉的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}待ってこら　逃げるんかい
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.48,0:56:17.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}なんやお前
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.41,0:56:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干掉他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やれ　こら
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.75,0:56:29.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.46,0:56:37.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你小子死定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}見てんだい　こら
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.84,0:56:40.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,临死前想说什么吗 外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna say something before you die, gaijin?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.55,0:56:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了 发生什么事情了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}なんや　何が起きたや
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.31,0:56:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}誰や
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.06,0:56:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被干掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やられたか
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.73,0:56:50.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(好梦酒店)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.79,0:57:53.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是担心才这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}心配だから言ってるでしょ
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.33,0:57:54.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后面就交给我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}後俺やるから
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.33,0:57:56.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 我担心 不行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ダメ　心配　ダメ
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.92,0:57:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 后面的我来就行了 - 不行 我还是担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 俺やってやるから　- 心配だから
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.00,0:58:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他醒了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}起きました
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.18,0:58:12.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是旅馆老板美惠和她的孙子仁志\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Mieko from the hotel and her grandson, Hitoshi.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.85,0:58:13.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是医生吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he a doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.98,0:58:17.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In a manner of speaking, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.61,0:58:19.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是个兽医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a veterinarian
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.94,0:58:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}student.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.28,0:58:24.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,研究大型动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Large animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.83,0:58:30.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.46,0:58:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他给你缝合时 你好像划了他几下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You may have cut him once or twice while he was stitching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.71,0:58:42.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 没事了 没事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.09,0:58:43.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些我来收拾就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}もう　私方付けて置くんで
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.92,0:58:45.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们去休息一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}少しお休みになってください
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.80,0:58:46.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}分かりました
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.89,0:58:55.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.73,0:59:02.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前从不需要这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never needed this before.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.07,0:59:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 帮助吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.53,0:59:14.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救治你爷爷的那个医生 金发的那个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That doctor, the one who helped your grandfather, the blonde.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.45,0:59:15.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.37,0:59:19.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她是爷爷去年去美国治疗时遇到的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He met her last year when he was in America for treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.96,0:59:23.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爷爷说我的自愈能力可以被夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your grandfather told me my healing could be taken from me,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.17,0:59:24.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,传给别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}passed on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.01,0:59:28.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这次没有像以前一样自愈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not getting better, not like before.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.14,0:59:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She did this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.98,0:59:43.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金发妞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blondie!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.69,0:59:45.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金发小姐姐 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}金髪の姉ちゃん　待ってって
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.15,0:59:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,金发妞 等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blondie!　待て待て待て
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.65,0:59:48.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这边嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}こち向けって
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.83,0:59:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}いいね
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.86,0:59:54.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开个价 开个价 开个价吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much? How much, yeah? How much?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.18,1:00:17.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我等了你两个小时 你一点都不尊重我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You kept me waiting two hours. You have no respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.56,1:00:19.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你还没找到他们吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you haven't found them?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.02,1:00:25.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别耍我 贱人 小心我杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't play with me, bitch. I could kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.58,1:00:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真能让我有任何感觉 原田 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you could make me feel something, Harada,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.15,1:00:29.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那简直太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would be sublime.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.74,1:00:31.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以把你这张漂亮的嘴划开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can slit your pretty mouth open,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.24,1:00:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,免得你说出什么蠢...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before you open it to say one more stupid...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.79,1:00:40.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只要你做一件事 小矮人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I asked you to do one thing, little man.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.12,1:00:42.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个变种人带来给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring me the mutant.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.83,1:00:45.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不效力于你 我是为...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't work for you. I work for the House of...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.09,1:00:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为矢志田效力 我明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You work for Yashida, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.55,1:00:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你却无法完成他的遗愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you cannot fulfill his dying wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.35,1:00:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天啊 你知道你让他有多失望吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My God, if you had any idea how much you have failed him.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.98,1:01:03.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根在哪儿 我还没处理完他呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is Logan? I am not done with him.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.98,1:01:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个变种人有超能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mutant has powers.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.53,1:01:16.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在不过是凡人之躯 肉体十分脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's just a man now. His flesh is weak now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.66,1:01:18.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.33,1:01:21.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我抑制了他的力量 好让他容易被抓到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I suppressed his power so he could be taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.08,1:01:24.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 你应该尊重我才对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, it's me you should respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.71,1:01:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赶在山口组之前找到他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just find them, before the Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.91,1:02:00.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该下车了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We get off here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.22,1:02:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.85,1:02:24.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就在长崎的外围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just outside Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.86,1:02:34.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.42,1:02:56.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是葬礼上的那个弓箭手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the guy from the funeral, the archer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.38,1:02:58.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是你前男友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was your boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.26,1:03:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他叫原田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's Harada.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.60,1:03:04.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那年夏天我们成了村里的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We were village champions that summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.56,1:03:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是射箭冠军 我是飞刀冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He with the bow and me with the knives.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.24,1:03:17.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原田和我本打算结婚的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harada and I were planning to get married.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.78,1:03:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被谁阻止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What stopped you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.62,1:03:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.95,1:03:23.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我们必须等到至少15岁才能结婚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said we had to wait until we were at least 15.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.34,1:03:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里有山珍 也有海味\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From the mountain, from the sea.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.55,1:03:36.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}いただきます
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.88,1:03:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}いただきます
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.31,1:03:49.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把筷子竖着插是不吉利的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Chopsticks upright are a bad omen.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:50.15,1:03:52.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为这像是在给死人上香\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It resembles incense at a funeral.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.65,1:03:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,万事皆有含义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing is without meaning.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.57,1:04:01.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么你跑出房间的那晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the other night at the house,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.16,1:04:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你跑进雨里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you ran out in the rain
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.87,1:04:04.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又是什么含义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what did that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.62,1:04:09.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时爷爷快死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandfather was dying.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.62,1:04:12.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早知道他会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You knew he was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.50,1:04:13.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他已经病了很久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd been sick for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.75,1:04:15.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我害怕的不是他的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It wasn't his death I feared.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.96,1:04:18.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what, then?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.89,1:04:22.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那晚他对你说什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did he tell you that night?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.43,1:04:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子 你父亲为什么打你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko, why did your father hit you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.89,1:04:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我试图提醒他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to warn him.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.48,1:04:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提醒什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.73,1:04:36.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爷爷对你说什么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did your grandfather tell you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.15,1:04:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me that
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.08,1:04:48.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三天后 当人们看到他的遗嘱时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in three days, when they read his will
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.33,1:04:54.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我将会成为全日本最有权势的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will become the most powerful person in Japan.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.46,1:05:00.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他把遗产都留给了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He gave it all to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.80,1:05:02.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,整个公司吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The company?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.35,1:05:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't want it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.31,1:05:12.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knew that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.56,1:05:17.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不明白他为什么要给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand why he gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:17.90,1:05:19.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我父亲梦寐以求的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was all my father dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:21.32,1:05:22.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许这就是原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.41,1:05:30.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的未婚夫呢 那个"森特郎"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about this fiance of yours? Nostromo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.75,1:05:31.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是森信郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Noburo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.16,1:05:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道这事吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does he know about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.87,1:05:34.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.67,1:05:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你为什么要嫁给他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you marrying him?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.96,1:05:40.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看起来像个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He seems like kind of an asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.76,1:05:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸去年安排好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father arranged it last year.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.64,1:05:49.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 这对他的仕途有帮助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - It gives him a better access to the political theater.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.44,1:05:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,违逆父命会令他蒙羞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To disobey my father would be to dishonor him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.53,1:06:03.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不指望你能理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't expect you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.78,1:06:08.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又不是日本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not Japanese.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.33,1:06:17.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没找到我女儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}まだ娘を見つけられんのか
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.46,1:06:18.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的岛形状狭长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}この細長い島国には
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.79,1:06:20.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有上下两个方向的路线跟铁路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}道も線路も登りと下りしかないというのに
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.76,1:06:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们到底在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}何をやってるんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.47,1:06:24.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄大人 请您放心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}信玄様　ご安心ください
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.01,1:06:26.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的手下已经尽全力在找了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私の部下が総力をあげて取り組んでおります
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.14,1:06:28.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们都是一群废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}こいつらは相当な愚か者だな
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.14,1:06:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你浪费了我太多时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}わしの時間を無駄にしよって
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.97,1:06:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还要处理父亲的事务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}父のことで色々忙しんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.60,1:06:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不去找人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}探しに行かんのか
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.31,1:06:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}はい
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.74,1:06:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请告诉我 你的线人有好消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me you have more promising news from your contacts.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.86,1:06:48.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会在三天后宣读遗嘱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They open the will in three days.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.28,1:06:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们快没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.66,1:06:54.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有望很快解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soon, I hope.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.29,1:06:57.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我正派人去南部\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sending men to the South.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.08,1:06:58.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是我们发现尸体的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's where we found the bodies.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.10,1:07:11.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果山口组闯入葬礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}葬儀にヤクザが紛れたことは
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.56,1:07:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说明有内鬼接应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}内に通してるものがいるってことでしょ
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.60,1:07:16.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放心 他们绝对不会发现我在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}大丈夫　ここなら絶対に見つからないから
Dialogue: 0,1:07:17.60,1:07:19.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}危険だよ
Dialogue: 0,1:07:20.52,1:07:21.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就去找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今すぐそっちに行くから
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.82,1:07:23.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行 他们会跟着你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ダメよ　付けられるわ
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.82,1:07:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不用担心我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}心配しないで
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.28,1:07:26.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お願い
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.36,1:07:28.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再给我几天时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あと数日間だけ頂戴
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.07,1:07:29.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私なら大丈夫
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.82,1:07:31.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根也在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ローガンもいるし
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.45,1:07:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是他不是受伤了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}彼ケガしてるじゃない
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.70,1:07:35.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}真理子ちゃん
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.29,1:07:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}誰か来た
Dialogue: 0,1:07:36.33,1:07:37.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.16,1:07:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我得挂了 - 喂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 行かなきゃ　- もしもし?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.30,1:07:39.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:40.54,1:07:41.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.54,1:07:42.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真理子 - 婆婆 怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 真理子ちゃん?　- どうしたの?　おばあちゃん
Dialogue: 0,1:07:42.80,1:07:45.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子 有棵大树倒在路上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}真理子ちゃん　道路に大きな木が倒れてさ
Dialogue: 0,1:07:45.76,1:07:49.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些小伙子想把它搬开 但那棵树动都不动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}若い人がどけようとしとったけど　なかなかどけられんくてよ
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.14,1:07:53.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叔叔 请喝茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}おとうさん　お茶入ります
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.81,1:07:57.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦您了 小心烫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お疲れ様です　熱いで気を付けてください
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.00,1:08:22.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.51,1:08:27.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tired.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.88,1:08:29.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you need something?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.89,1:08:32.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:36.22,1:08:37.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 您好 - 您好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- こんにちは　- こんにちは
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.64,1:08:40.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 有苹果吗 - 苹果吗 给你 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- リンゴもあるかな　- リンゴ?　な　ありがとう
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.94,1:08:43.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个对你有好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will help.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.66,1:09:35.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.29,1:09:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.29,1:09:43.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托 收下它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please. Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.46,1:09:46.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.31,1:10:06.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.40,1:10:09.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用两只手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.36,1:10:13.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本刀需要双手握\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Japanese sword require two hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.99,1:10:20.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 像这样吗 - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like that? - That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.83,1:10:25.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮 矢志田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's beautiful, Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.71,1:10:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我不能收下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I can't take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.34,1:10:31.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.80,1:10:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.47,1:10:41.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it safe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:44.52,1:10:46.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,替我好好保管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep it safe for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:48.94,1:10:50.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总有一天我会来取的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Someday, I'll come get it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.24,1:11:00.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是时候了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.96,1:11:51.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当时我就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was here when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.96,1:11:55.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是我遇到你爷爷的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's how I met your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.67,1:11:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们藏在那儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We hid in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.43,1:12:02.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听过这个故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard the stories.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.52,1:12:08.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的爷爷说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandfather would say
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.35,1:12:09.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里发生的一切证明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what happened here was proof
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.52,1:12:12.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世间万物都会归于平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that everything in the world finds peace.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:16.19,1:12:17.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最终会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eventually.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:22.58,1:12:24.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人遇到任何事 都可以恢复如初\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That man can recover from anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.08,1:12:30.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许你也能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.42,1:12:39.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你睡得很不安稳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't sleep very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.84,1:12:41.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总在半夜大声叫喊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You call out in the night.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.48,1:12:49.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Jean?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.78,1:13:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们该回去了 要下雨了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should go back. There's rain coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.14,1:13:29.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来泡茶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll make tea.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:38.11,1:13:39.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.23,1:14:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.24,1:14:33.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该打成武士结\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need this tied like a proper samurai.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.63,1:14:39.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的爷爷称我为浪人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your grandfather called me a ronin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:41.13,1:14:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无主的武士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A samurai without a master.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.34,1:14:47.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说我将注定永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said I was destined to live forever...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.64,1:14:51.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但却没有活下去的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with no reason to live.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.06,1:14:58.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说的对吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was he right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.82,1:15:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.32,1:15:07.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,依然如此吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.46,1:16:00.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.34,1:16:07.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不会有好结果的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't going to end well.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.35,1:16:14.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你爱的每一个人都会死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone you love dies.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.99,1:16:36.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狼獾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.08,1:16:40.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道这个词是什么意思吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.51,1:16:46.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An animal.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.38,1:16:52.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一种有长爪和锋利牙齿的凶猛动物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A fierce creature with long claws and sharp teeth.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.81,1:16:56.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它无畏无惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It fears nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.64,1:17:02.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小的时候 常被噩梦惊醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was a girl, I had nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:03.27,1:17:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后跑去找爸爸妈妈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd wake up and run to my parents.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.69,1:17:08.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爸爸会发怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father would get angry.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.87,1:17:16.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,"回去睡觉 直面你的恐惧"\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Go back to sleep. Face your fears."
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.41,1:17:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爷爷则不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandfather was different.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.75,1:17:25.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会跟我说他的朋友狼獾的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me stories about Kuzuri, his friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.50,1:17:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是在井底遇到的他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who he met at the bottom of a well.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.76,1:17:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说 狼獾有魔力 救了他的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said the Kuzuri was magical and saved his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.52,1:17:43.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他还说 狼獾也会在我睡觉的时候保护我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said Kuzuri would protect me, too, as I slept in my bed.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.03,1:17:54.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's Jean?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.25,1:18:03.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她和你一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is she like you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.54,1:18:08.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened to her?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.88,1:18:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She died.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.47,1:18:19.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I killed her.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.94,1:18:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,连同狼獾也一起死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Along with the Kuzuri.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.28,1:19:11.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.92,1:19:27.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.96,1:19:31.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行け
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.09,1:19:33.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.92,1:19:35.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.59,1:19:37.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.68,1:19:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.35,1:19:47.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.65,1:19:50.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.23,1:19:51.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.20,1:20:04.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.50,1:20:05.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.87,1:20:08.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.46,1:20:11.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.86,1:20:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.13,1:20:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko! Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.84,1:20:18.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.74,1:20:41.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要带她去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they taking her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.28,1:20:42.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们要带她去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are they taking her?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.08,1:20:44.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去哪里 你个人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where, you piece of shit?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:46.50,1:20:48.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会说的 外国佬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I no talk, gaijin.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.62,1:20:51.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我永远都不会说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never talk.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.96,1:20:59.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁雇的你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who hired you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.45,1:21:25.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我去见森信郎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take me to Noburo.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:25.83,1:21:28.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 带我去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Logan? - Take me to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:28.79,1:21:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要告诉你一些事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.96,1:21:32.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带我去 立刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.27,1:21:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在车里等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.73,1:21:55.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 罗根 - 怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Logan. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.52,1:21:57.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我预见到你的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.53,1:21:59.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.57,1:22:01.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我预见到你死亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.82,1:22:04.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候 刚刚吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When? Just now?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.24,1:22:06.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不久之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A while ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.33,1:22:09.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我看到的幻象并不完整\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's not like I get a complete picture.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.21,1:22:12.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更像是管中窥豹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More like looking through a keyhole.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.04,1:22:15.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我向来都是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:17.25,1:22:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我所能预见的只是人们一生的一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I can see is one part of a person's life...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.05,1:22:22.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their death.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.43,1:22:25.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到了你的死亡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I saw yours.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.64,1:22:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底看到了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what did you see?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.23,1:22:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到你躺着 到处都是血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you on your back. There's blood everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.57,1:22:39.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你手里握着自己的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're holding your own heart in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.74,1:22:44.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它不再跳动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not beating.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.53,1:22:47.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没时间听这些废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't have time for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.03,1:22:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我5岁时 就知道我的父母会怎样死去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was five, I knew how my own parents would die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.33,1:22:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后我在后座目睹了它的发生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then I watched it happen from the back seat.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:59.71,1:23:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.01,1:23:06.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多人都曾尝试杀我 可是我还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A lot of people have tried to kill me, and I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.14,1:23:07.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.79,1:23:11.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你现在不一样了 不是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you're different now, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.27,1:23:13.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能伤害到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.23,1:23:15.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们能杀掉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They can kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:16.52,1:23:17.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好在车里等着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just wait in the car.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.37,1:23:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我叫你在车里等着 - 你需要后援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said, wait in the car. - You need backup.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:31.58,1:23:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以你现在的情况 你并不安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not safe, not in your condition.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.46,1:23:37.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把我当成你的保镖就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just think of me as your bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:46.80,1:23:48.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sexy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.73,1:23:57.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 马上就来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - I'm coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.77,1:23:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ちょっと待ってね
Dialogue: 0,1:24:05.99,1:24:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第四轮 现在开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, round four. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.62,1:24:12.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这屁股真性感\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}いいお尻だね
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.72,1:24:32.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:38.52,1:24:39.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没说你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.11,1:24:43.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算我是老古董\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call me old-fashioned...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:43.32,1:24:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我以为订婚以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I thought being engaged
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.61,1:24:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就意味着不能再这么乱搞了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}meant you were done with this kind of bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.28,1:24:47.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是司法部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the Minister of Justice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.61,1:24:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我能把你怎么样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have any idea what I could do to you?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.20,1:24:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧你 你竟然打算穿着你的小红内裤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? You're gonna try and talk tough,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.03,1:24:52.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站在那里 对我放狠话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}standing there in your red underwear?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.54,1:24:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以用十个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have ten words...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.91,1:24:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十个词\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ten words...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.12,1:25:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对我解释清楚 为什么 你 一个司法部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to explain to me why you, the Minister of Justice...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.67,1:25:04.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会希望你的未婚妻被山口组杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would want your fiance killed by the Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.38,1:25:06.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我不满意你的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I don't like what you say,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.46,1:25:09.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就把你从这窗户丢出去摔死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are going through that fucking window.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.76,1:25:12.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全不了解现在的情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have the faintest idea what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.76,1:25:16.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 他这句话几个词了 - 九个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How many words was that? - Nine.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.73,1:25:19.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九个 只剩一个词了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine. You have one word left.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.44,1:25:23.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.19,1:25:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是信玄 是信玄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shingen. Shingen!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.82,1:25:29.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接着说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.12,1:25:33.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他生病以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since he got sick...
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.62,1:25:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田老头花了无数的钱求医\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}old man Yashida spent billions on doctors, healers.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.20,1:25:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在北部的实验室囤积艾德曼合金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stockpiling adamantium at his lab in the North,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.12,1:25:42.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秘密尝试延长自己的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}secretly trying to prolong his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.79,1:25:45.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害公司到了破产的边缘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He brought the company to the edge of bankruptcy.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.96,1:25:47.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他执迷于你的永生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was obsessed with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.97,1:25:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些懂事们都已经...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}当部の役員たちはすでに
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.93,1:25:52.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说英语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}English!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.55,1:25:55.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄为保护那个老头撒谎了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shingen lied, protected the old man
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.72,1:25:58.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并向股东和董事会隐瞒了债务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}concealed the debt from stockholders and the board.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.23,1:26:01.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他努力做个好儿子 以为会有回报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He tried to be a good son and thought he'd be rewarded.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.65,1:26:04.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果老头把一切都留给了孙女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the old man left everything to his granddaughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.98,1:26:06.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果真理子得到全部的权力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Mariko got all that power,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.36,1:26:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会一脚踹了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she would dump his ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.65,1:26:08.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's true.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.86,1:26:11.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗嘱一旦被宣读出来 真理子就...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko would have never gone through with the wedding...
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.03,1:26:14.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绝无可能举行婚礼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not once the will was revealed.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.28,1:26:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她从来都不喜欢我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She never took to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.83,1:26:19.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 像你这样杰出的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really? A class act like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:20.21,1:26:23.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄许诺我 只要我帮他 就给我一大笔钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shingen promised me a fortune for my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.17,1:26:28.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你就把枪口对准了他女儿 是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you put a hit on his daughter. Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.84,1:26:31.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,政治生涯无法长久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Political careers don't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:31.55,1:26:32.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这话倒是真的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:32.76,1:26:34.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等 等等 不要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait! Wait! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.80,1:26:36.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想要真相 我已经告诉你真相了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wanted the truth. I told you the truth!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:38.47,1:26:39.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢你的答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't like it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.73,1:26:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}助けて
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.15,1:26:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么知道下面有个游泳池\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you know there's a pool down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.65,1:26:46.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:57.70,1:26:58.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,辛苦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ご苦労
Dialogue: 0,1:27:03.33,1:27:07.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我在大学主修的是生物吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前は知っていたかな　私が大学で生物学を学んだことを
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.55,1:27:11.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遗传学\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}遺伝学
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.01,1:27:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些基因是隔代遗传的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}遺伝子は世代を飛び越えることもある
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.97,1:27:19.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隐性基因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}劣性遺伝子
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.73,1:27:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛 还有头发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}目や髪
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.02,1:27:27.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天赋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}才能
Dialogue: 0,1:27:28.57,1:27:29.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,性格\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}気質
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.11,1:27:35.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,并非每个孩子都会遗传相同的特点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}全ての子供が等しく受け継げるわけではない
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.11,1:27:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲并没有在我身上看到他自己的影子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}父は私の中にではなく
Dialogue: 0,1:27:39.49,1:27:41.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是在你身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前の中にこそ
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.37,1:27:43.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了他自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}自分自身を見出していたのだ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.31,1:28:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是如何说服我父亲给予你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}どうやってお前がアジア最大の企業を支配できるよう
Dialogue: 0,1:28:06.60,1:28:08.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,亚洲最大组织的控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}父を説得したんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.23,1:28:09.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}狂ってるわ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.69,1:28:13.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非也 是我终于醒悟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}いや　やっと目覚めたんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:15.11,1:28:17.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果杀了我 你会失去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私を殺せば　お父様の
Dialogue: 0,1:28:17.07,1:28:19.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仅存的一点荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}僅かな見栄も全て失われるのよ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.87,1:28:20.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やめて
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.49,1:28:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要担心 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}心配するな真理子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.95,1:28:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想伤害你 我想保护你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私はお前を傷つけるどころが守ってやりたいのだ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.71,1:28:28.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我来终结你的苦痛 - 放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 痛みを止めてやる　- 放して
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.08,1:28:29.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你实现你的愿望吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前の望みを叶えてやろう
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.00,1:28:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你完成那天被那个怪物阻止的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの日　化け物に邪魔されてできなかったことが
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.67,1:28:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我并不想死 爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私が死にたかったわけじゃない
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.39,1:28:48.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}放してよ
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.65,1:28:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事了 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}大丈夫だ　真理子
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.16,1:29:01.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 怎么回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- 一緒に来い　- どういうこと?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.07,1:29:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是无法想象的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前には想像もつかないことさ
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.59,1:29:12.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.75,1:29:14.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.34,1:29:19.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉打扰 但我需要你女儿活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry to interrupt, but I need your daughter alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.26,1:29:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:21.47,1:29:24.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,化学家 虚无主义者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A chemist, a nihilist...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.51,1:29:27.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,资本家 基因突变者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a capitalist, a mutation.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.40,1:29:32.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝰蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A viper.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.14,1:30:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保安在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the security?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.87,1:30:26.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山口组\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yakuza.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.33,1:30:29.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,信玄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shingen?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.14,1:30:51.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.74,1:30:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(来救她)
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.03,1:31:03.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里 这个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This. This here.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.78,1:31:04.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.83,1:31:10.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田大人出生的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master Yashida's birthplace.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.79,1:31:14.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司在山腰建立了一个机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The company built a facility into the mountainside.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.30,1:31:19.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How far?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.09,1:31:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离这里500公里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}500 kilometers from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.74,1:32:31.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要把它从体内取出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta get that thing out of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.54,1:32:33.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.83,1:32:35.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 停下 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.16,1:32:38.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我预见了你的死亡 我从没错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you die. I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:38.25,1:32:39.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从来都没错过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm never wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:39.58,1:32:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是每次都是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not always right.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.42,1:32:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就没预见到那个老头的死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't know the old man was gonna bite it.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.96,1:32:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我看到你死在像这样的屋子里 心脏握在手里...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw you die in a room like this with your heart in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:44.05,1:32:46.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能让她在那群疯子和杀人狂手里 雪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't leave her with those freaks and killers, Yukio.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:46.13,1:32:47.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是她获救的唯一机会 \N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm the only chance she's got,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:47.92,1:32:49.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我得先把那东西弄出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but not with that thing inside me.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.51,1:32:50.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会死的 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going to die, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:50.93,1:32:52.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许那也没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.81,1:32:54.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 听我说 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, listen to me, Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:54.64,1:32:57.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 快住手 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop. Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.02,1:32:59.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下去你还是不要看的好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna want to watch this part.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:59.19,1:33:01.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 住手 快住手 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No! Listen to me! Please, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.44,1:33:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要 快住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:06.45,1:33:07.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:16.29,1:33:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:17.46,1:33:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你离他远点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from him.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:20.29,1:33:21.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他害死了你的主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He killed your master.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.75,1:33:24.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,染指你的姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put hands on your sister.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:25.71,1:33:27.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在你竟然想要他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now you want him?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.18,1:33:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好 我看不见那东西了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no. I can't see.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:32.97,1:33:35.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你永远都不过是个要饭的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll always be a beggar.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.10,1:33:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.23,1:33:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.81,1:34:17.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yukio.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.58,1:34:38.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.67,1:34:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan! Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.71,1:34:49.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.17,1:35:34.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不准伤害我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hit my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:37.22,1:35:38.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where's Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.31,1:35:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不在了 蝰蛇那个贱人把她带走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone. That Viper bitch took her.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.43,1:35:45.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都怪我父亲对基因突变的痴迷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was my father's obsession with mutation,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:46.23,1:35:47.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不过是上帝的失误\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with God's mistakes
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.77,1:35:50.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如你和她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you and her,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.23,1:35:53.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那毁了我们整个家族\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that ruined this house.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:05.93,1:37:07.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你试图对自己的亲生女儿下毒手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You tried to kill your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.23,1:37:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带着这份愧疚活着吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live with that.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.83,1:37:29.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟是什么怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of monster are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:30.58,1:37:32.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是金刚狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.43,1:37:48.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心 慢慢起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, come here, come here. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.48,1:37:50.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:50.65,1:37:51.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:52.31,1:37:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我看看你的伤\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me have a look at you.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.23,1:37:56.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.32,1:37:59.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:11.54,1:38:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个陷阱 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a trap, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:33.02,1:38:34.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这到底是什么地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}なんなのよここは
Dialogue: 0,1:38:35.65,1:38:37.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你究竟对我隐瞒了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}何を隠してるの?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:37.03,1:38:39.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你马上就能知道了 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}すぐわかるさ　真理子
Dialogue: 0,1:38:41.11,1:38:42.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欢迎啊 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Welcome, Mariko.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:44.53,1:38:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别怕 真理子 她也是为矢志田家效力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right, Mariko. She also serves the House of Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:47.70,1:38:49.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她只为自己效力吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She serves herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.50,1:38:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她对罗根下手了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She infected Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:53.33,1:38:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what about Grandfather?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.50,1:38:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你对他使用了什么致命手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you infect him with?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.97,1:39:01.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是实现他的遗愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I granted his dying wish.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.93,1:39:04.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他安息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I helped him rest.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:07.43,1:39:09.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在 轮到你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, it's your turn.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:17.88,1:39:18.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,过来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}手を貸せ
Dialogue: 0,1:39:43.18,1:39:46.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我听好 变种人 不准伤害她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me, mutant. She will not be harmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.60,1:39:49.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不会有事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She will be fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:50.27,1:39:52.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前提是你把你的事做好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long as you do your job.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:53.89,1:39:56.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根很快就会到 我们要做好准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan will be here soon, we should prepare.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:56.61,1:39:58.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引他过来是一回事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was easy to lure him here.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.15,1:40:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要抓住他可没那么简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's another thing to capture him.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:00.96,1:40:03.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们准备好了 他没见识过黑衣族的厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're ready. He's never faced the Black Clan.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.45,1:40:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没错 但...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, well...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.12,1:40:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你的箭头蘸上这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dip your arrows in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.70,1:40:14.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不会杀死他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It won't kill him,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.96,1:40:17.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但能让他动作变慢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it will slow him down.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.33,1:40:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不需要你的毒液\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your potions.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.63,1:40:21.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他现在很弱 根本不是我们的对手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's no challenge for us now. He's weak.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.76,1:40:23.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:26.13,1:40:27.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过如果你失败了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when you fail,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.97,1:40:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以继续用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have this.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.45,1:40:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,休息得怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you have a nice rest?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.50,1:40:58.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道你究竟用了什么卑鄙手段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you said or did
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.83,1:41:00.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欺骗了原田和爷爷 但是...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to deceive Harada or my grandfather...
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.04,1:41:01.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, now, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:02.09,1:41:04.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你爷爷先找上我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your grandfather sought me out.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:04.42,1:41:06.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我是这个家族的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am the head of this family now.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:10.55,1:41:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道为什么选你吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why do you suppose that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:15.06,1:41:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么那个老头子会选择你作为继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think the old man chose you?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.19,1:41:22.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为觉得你够强大吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you are strong?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.90,1:41:25.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是因为你够软弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or because you are weak?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.13,1:42:22.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你是来大战一场的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see you've come to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:22.88,1:42:24.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's pointless.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.25,1:42:26.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很虚弱 而且寡不敌众\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're weak. You're outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.71,1:42:31.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑衣族世代保护矢志田家族已经有七百年\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Black Clan has protected the House of Yashida for 700 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:32.30,1:42:34.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就带了这么点人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that all the men you brought?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:37.14,1:42:38.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去救她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna get her.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.39,1:42:41.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们非常感谢你之前对真理子的保护\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are grateful for your protection of Mariko.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.48,1:42:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是为了她的家族 你还需要做一个牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there is one more sacrifice you must make for her family.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:45.94,1:42:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,滚蛋去吧 小帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go fuck yourself, pretty boy.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.33,1:42:57.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}やれ
Dialogue: 0,1:43:23.48,1:43:25.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都给我上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}マーキネス　行くぞ
Dialogue: 0,1:43:58.76,1:43:59.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}行け
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.17,1:45:51.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雪生 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yukio, run!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.28,1:47:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.96,1:48:37.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.59,1:48:39.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kayla.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:39.30,1:48:41.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 凯拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you. Kayla!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:41.26,1:48:42.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:48.10,1:48:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:50.51,1:48:51.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jean.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:52.60,1:48:53.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Save me.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:25.34,1:49:27.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退下 没必要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back. There is no need.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.51,1:49:29.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪儿 真理子在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she? Where's Mariko?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:29.51,1:49:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.43,1:49:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Where is Mariko?"
Dialogue: 0,1:49:33.52,1:49:35.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还在为她伤心呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Still pining away?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:36.31,1:49:37.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真感人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's so sweet.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:39.19,1:49:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叹为观止吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Impressive, no?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.36,1:49:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也是用艾德曼合金制成的 跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is made of Adamantium, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:55.41,1:49:59.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根 我能体会你的心情 你很沮丧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Logan, you know what, I get it. You're frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:59.67,1:50:02.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道她在这儿 我要见她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know she's here. I want to see her.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:02.67,1:50:04.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想知道答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want answers.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:04.76,1:50:05.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 我想要答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, I want answers!
Dialogue: 0,1:50:05.42,1:50:08.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉了 我也想告诉你答案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, I wish I could say more,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:08.13,1:50:10.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但人家就是看中我嘴巴牢才雇的我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I was hired in part for my discretion.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:10.34,1:50:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我相信也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.43,1:50:13.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,此外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.85,1:50:18.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有把生物化学与形而上学结合起来的才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and a certain talent for combining biochemistry and metaphysics.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:19.06,1:50:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,剧毒是我的专长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High-grade toxins are my specialty.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:22.31,1:50:27.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对人类已知的全部毒素天生免疫 还挺有用的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It helps to be genetically immune to every poison known to man, as I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.07,1:50:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我甚至对人类自身的各种缺陷都免疫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And immune to the toxin that is man himself, as I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:34.95,1:50:37.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我告诉你 你这个扭曲的变种贱人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll tell you what, you twisted mutant bitch,
Dialogue: 0,1:50:38.21,1:50:39.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不如现在就打开手铐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why don't you open these bracelets
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.96,1:50:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们比比看究竟谁更强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we'll see who's made of what?
Dialogue: 0,1:50:46.51,1:50:48.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,秀爪子啦 那我们开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The claws. Now we can begin.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.47,1:50:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你对他有感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前はあいつに思いを寄せてるのは知ってる
Dialogue: 0,1:50:54.26,1:50:55.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你必须忘了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}でも忘れる
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.02,1:50:58.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是矢志田家的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}お前は矢志田家の人間なんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:50:58.48,1:51:00.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个女人背叛了爷爷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あの女はお爺様を裏切ったのよ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:00.77,1:51:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也一样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あなたもそうってことでしょ?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:02.56,1:51:03.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错了 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}違う　真理子
Dialogue: 0,1:51:03.81,1:51:05.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们从小一起长大的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺たちは幼馴染だろう?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.98,1:51:07.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺を信じてくれ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:07.69,1:51:10.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你让开 我要去下面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}そこをどいて　下に行かなきゃ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:10.45,1:51:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他没对你做过任何事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}彼はあなたに何もしてないじゃない?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:12.28,1:51:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了我的命啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}私の命を救ってくれたのよ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:13.12,1:51:15.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘了他吧 真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}あいつを忘れろ　真理子
Dialogue: 0,1:51:15.95,1:51:17.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不愿意这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺も辛いんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.37,1:51:20.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在按照你爷爷的计划行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}でも俺は　お前のお爺さんの計画に従う
Dialogue: 0,1:51:20.41,1:51:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你心脏上的那只虫子是我放进去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The suppressant bug you found inside of you was mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:24.00,1:51:26.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你竟然亲手把它取出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You took it out on your own.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:28.01,1:51:29.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还真没料到这一出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't see that coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:30.05,1:51:31.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蝰蛇是个危险的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ワイバーが危険なのは
Dialogue: 0,1:51:31.55,1:51:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺も知ってる
Dialogue: 0,1:51:32.55,1:51:36.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但她只不过是为了完成你爷爷愿望的一枚棋子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}でもあいつは　お前のお爺さんの願いを叶えるまでの駒だ
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.06,1:51:37.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.97,1:51:39.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}心配するな
Dialogue: 0,1:51:39.31,1:51:40.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很强大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.27,1:51:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你充满勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.85,1:51:45.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真正的勇气\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Real courage.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:48.78,1:51:51.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但现在勇气也帮不了你多少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But that won't help much now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.92,1:52:05.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么鬼...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the...
Dialogue: 0,1:52:06.71,1:52:08.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要相信我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺を信じてくれ
Dialogue: 0,1:52:08.88,1:52:10.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信我很难吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}難しいことか
Dialogue: 0,1:52:10.88,1:52:13.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们命中注定要在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}俺たちもっと強い絆で結ばれてんだ
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.05,1:52:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在也是一样吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}今でもそうだろう
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.01,1:52:18.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}そうよね
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.75,1:52:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:54.38,1:52:55.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}マジか
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.47,1:53:02.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:05.35,1:53:06.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:07.44,1:53:08.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:21.87,1:53:22.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.10,1:53:40.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真理子 快走 - 快跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Mariko, come! - Go! Run!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.66,1:54:01.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子 快出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko, get out!
Dialogue: 0,1:56:35.35,1:56:36.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}止めろ
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.12,1:56:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:52.12,1:56:53.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样是不对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:06.80,1:57:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两手握刀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.73,1:57:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Master.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:22.19,1:57:24.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嘿 大块头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Bub!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.97,1:57:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Harada.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:51.22,1:57:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ごめんなさい
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.61,1:58:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you die.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:45.23,1:58:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天不是我的死期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today is not my day.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:40.58,1:59:41.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan-san.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.12,1:59:44.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用这么惊讶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look so shocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:46.71,1:59:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在长崎时 多亏有你 我才躲过一劫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With you at my side, I survived Nagasaki.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:50.76,1:59:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,显然 这次我依然能挺过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely, I could survive this.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:54.68,1:59:58.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的 很快就好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all right. It won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:58.31,2:00:01.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,格林医生和我都在等待这一刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dr. Green and I have been waiting.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:01.69,2:00:05.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在全靠这身盔甲维持着我的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's only this armor that's kept me alive.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:05.36,2:00:07.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们造了这个东西让我变得强壮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We built it to make me strong,
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.53,2:00:10.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样我就能夺取你不愿意给我的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I can take what you would not give.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:10.24,2:00:13.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把你不想要的自愈能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And transfer your unwanted healing
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.53,2:00:16.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,转移到我身上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to my body.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.20,2:00:21.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的千秋家业必须被保护好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My legacy must be preserved.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:22.75,2:00:24.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的错误就在于相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your mistake was to believe
Dialogue: 0,2:00:24.57,2:00:28.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无止尽的生命是没有意义的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a life without end can have no meaning.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:31.05,2:00:33.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有无止尽的生命才有意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is the only life that can.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:35.22,2:00:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再坚持下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:36.68,2:00:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就快好了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are almost there.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:38.81,2:00:42.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一直祈求的平静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The peace, the peace you've wanted.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:43.44,2:00:45.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的奖励\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your reward.
Dialogue: 0,2:00:46.23,2:00:51.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这可是赐予了你 你一直期盼的死亡啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm giving you the very death you longed for.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:05.00,2:01:06.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种感觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This feeling,
Dialogue: 0,2:01:06.92,2:01:09.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成为无敌的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be invincible
Dialogue: 0,2:01:12.17,2:01:13.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就跟你一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like you.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:26.48,2:01:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是真正的怪物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}本物の化け物はあなたよ
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.27,2:01:30.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:31.23,2:01:34.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是我啊 是爷爷啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's me. Your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:35.53,2:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爷爷已经入土了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I buried my grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:40.47,2:02:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是请我来跟你告别的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You asked me to come say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:43.56,2:02:44.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,永别了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sayonara.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:07.66,2:03:08.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.97,2:03:20.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:30.06,2:03:31.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:34.86,2:03:35.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Logan.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:48.12,2:03:49.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're here.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.04,2:03:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:55.25,2:03:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能留下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you stay?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:59.51,2:04:00.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:03.76,2:04:05.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:07.10,2:04:08.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你一直想要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is what you wanted.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:11.56,2:04:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:18.03,2:04:19.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一个人在这里很孤单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm all alone here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.74,2:04:26.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你将我置于此地的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You put me here.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:28.62,2:04:30.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你当时伤害了别人 琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were hurting people, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.25,2:04:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不得不那么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:42.22,2:04:43.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爱你 琴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you, Jean.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.02,2:04:51.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会永远爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I always will.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:25.01,2:05:26.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会很寂寞的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}寂しくなるわ
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.35,2:05:30.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我唯一的家人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}たっだ一人の家族なんだから
Dialogue: 0,2:05:32.68,2:05:35.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保重 姐姐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}元気でね　お姉ちゃん
Dialogue: 0,2:05:48.70,2:05:51.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认为你还会来看我 是不是错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I wrong to think you might visit me soon?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:03.55,2:06:04.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,留下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:06.47,2:06:08.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能 公主殿下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't, princess.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:08.85,2:06:10.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是个战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm a soldier,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:10.56,2:06:12.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经逃避自己的职责太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I've been hiding too long.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:25.74,2:06:28.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日财经人物采访 真理子·矢志田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In our business profile tonight, Mariko Yashida.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.53,2:06:31.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,矢志田家族继承大权移交第三代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A two-generation passing of the torch in the Yashida family
Dialogue: 0,2:06:31.49,2:06:34.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科技巨头创始人之孙女真理子·矢志田\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as Mariko Yashida takes the helm from her grandfather,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:34.50,2:06:35.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将从爷爷手中接过整个家族事业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who built this tech giant.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:35.79,2:06:37.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我明白对任何一个公司来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know it will always be the purpose
Dialogue: 0,2:06:37.75,2:06:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,赚钱永远是个目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a corporation to make a profit,
Dialogue: 0,2:06:40.21,2:06:42.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是矢志田工业相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but Yashida Industries believes
Dialogue: 0,2:06:42.00,2:06:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们同时也能服务整个社会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we can also work with our community.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:50.76,2:06:53.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你决定好了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, have you decided?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.81,2:06:56.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,决定什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:56.94,2:06:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真理子说我们可以想去哪就去哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mariko says we can go wherever we want.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.35,2:07:00.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要说个地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just say where.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:02.44,2:07:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:05.74,2:07:07.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是你的保镖呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your bodyguard.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:12.12,2:07:13.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想去哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, where do you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.54,2:07:19.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先起飞再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's just start with up.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:19.75,2:07:20.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:25.38,2:07:26.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:29.47,2:07:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:11.97,2:09:15.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《金刚狼2》
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.06,2:09:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(两年后)
Dialogue: 0,2:09:22.50,2:09:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拥有最尖端的科技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With cutting edge technology,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:24.33,2:09:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以及最具智慧的科技人才\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the world's leading minds,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:26.38,2:09:28.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们站在世界的前沿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are on the frontlines,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.25,2:09:31.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保障您的身心健康和人身安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}keeping you healthy, keeping you safe.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:32.22,2:09:33.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特拉斯克工业\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Trask Industries.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.88,2:09:36.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今日解决明日忧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Solving tomorrow's problems, today.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:37.76,2:09:38.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我选择搜身安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take the pat-down.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.89,2:09:40.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退出机器安检\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Opt out.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:53.11,2:09:54.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,您可以过了 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can go ahead, sir.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:54.24,2:09:55.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我再等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:04.12,2:10:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:07.13,2:10:09.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑暗势力在蠢蠢欲动 金刚狼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are dark forces, Wolverine.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:11.30,2:10:13.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类正在建造某种武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human forces building a weapon
Dialogue: 0,2:10:13.55,2:10:17.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能会给变种人带来灭顶之灾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that could bring about the end of our kind.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:19.97,2:10:22.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问我要干什么 我需要你的援助\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do I want? I want your help.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:23.56,2:10:25.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I trust you?
Dialogue: 0,2:10:26.35,2:10:27.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自然不会信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:52.30,2:10:53.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 罗根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello, Logan.
Dialogue: 0,2:10:58.05,2:10:59.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How is this possible?
Dialogue: 0,2:11:00.05,2:11:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正如我很久之前告诉过你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I told you a long time ago,
Dialogue: 0,2:11:04.02,2:11:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有天赋的人 不止你一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you are not the only one with gifts.
